  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "S1",
      "zh": "有些話，說不出口；就這樣一直收著。",
      "en": "Some things are hard to say. So you keep them in.",
      "in_point_s": {
        "zh": 1.0,
        "en": 1.0
      },
      "latest_end_s": {
        "zh": 5.1,
        "en": 6.0
      },
      "budget_s": {
        "zh": 4.1,
        "en": 5.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "S2",
      "zh": "第一次見面，它會自我介紹，也問你想不想幫它取名字。",
      "en": "When you first meet, it introduces itself and asks if you'd like to name it.",
      "in_point_s": {
        "zh": 8.1,
        "en": 8.1
      },
      "latest_end_s": {
        "zh": 14.1,
        "en": 14.6
      },
      "budget_s": {
        "zh": 6.0,
        "en": 6.5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "S3",
      "zh": "它會先聽你說完，接住你的心情，不急著給建議。",
      "en": "It listens first, sits with how you feel, and doesn't rush to give advice.",
      "in_point_s": {
        "zh": 16.6,
        "en": 16.6
      },
      "latest_end_s": {
        "zh": 21.9,
        "en": 23.0
      },
      "budget_s": {
        "zh": 5.3,
        "en": 6.4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "S4",
      "zh": "聊到相關的事，它會想起你寫過的某一天，記得那時候的你。",
      "en": "When it's relevant, it recalls a day you wrote about — by its date and title.",
      "in_point_s": {
        "zh": 24.7,
        "en": 24.7
      },
      "latest_end_s": {
        "zh": 31.7,
        "en": 31.6
      },
      "budget_s": {
        "zh": 7.0,
        "en": 6.9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "S5",
      "zh": "按一下，這段對話就成了一篇日記；行事曆那天，也多一枚小印章。",
      "en": "One tap, and the chat becomes a diary entry — plus a little stamp on your calendar.",
      "in_point_s": {
        "zh": 33.7,
        "en": 33.7
      },
      "latest_end_s": {
        "zh": 41.0,
        "en": 41.0
      },
      "budget_s": {
        "zh": 7.3,
        "en": 7.3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "S6-A",
      "zh": "開心的日子，有個小小的慶祝；",
      "en": "Good days get a little celebration.",
      "in_point_s": {
        "zh": 43.1,
        "en": 43.1
      },
      "latest_end_s": {
        "zh": 46.35,
        "en": 45.6
